# Public configuration only. Vite exposes VITE_* values in browser bundles.
# Calls only the backend API. Provider selection and credentials stay server-side.
# Leave unset: the page calls /api on its own origin and the Vite proxy forwards
# to the backend (ALGOLENS_API_TARGET, default http://127.0.0.1:8000). Set it only
# to call a backend on another origin directly; that backend then needs CORS_ORIGINS.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
